/**
 * SqliteStore — the local-default persistence adapter.
 *
 * This is the ONLY file in the whole codebase permitted to import bun:sqlite
 * (ISC-57). Every other module depends on the Store interface. Every method
 * that touches tenant data is scoped by userId in the WHERE clause (ISC-49).
 *
 * Upserts use `INSERT ... ON CONFLICT (...) DO UPDATE`, which both bun:sqlite
 * and Postgres understand, so the business-visible SQL stays portable (ISC-59).
 */

